cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Can Caregivers Trust the Score? Auditing the Signals of a Sentiment-Based Re-ranker for Children's Video Search"
abstract: >-
  Code and data that reproduce every result of the article: the training recipe of the
  YouTube Safe Kids sentiment classifier, the rules that assign franchise and content
  category to each corpus sentence, the two evaluation protocols, and the analyses of
  generalisation, demotion by content category, calibration, deferral and robustness.
type: software
